      "message": "test(3d): pin the sample 3D Pocket's full verify reading\n\nThe as-imported sample's 3D Pocket R1 generates ok but does not post\nwith the job's tool: its 15 mm flutes and 8 mm shank cannot reach the\n118 mm part, so verify names shank_hit and rapid_in_stock findings and\nholds the post by R1. The test now deletes S1 so the program gate runs,\nasserts that reading by name (no gouge), and asserts that the same path\nwith full-depth flutes verifies clean. The \"verifies clean\" claim is\nremoved from the doc comment and the decision file. The ladder's shank\nblindness is on main too; it is owed in #1844.\n\nRefs #1749\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>",
